WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.008
Water Beings · Digital population, recorded. [Silent]

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:22.200
First tank prototype · Overhead recording.
[Quiet location sound]

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:33.900
The smaller hull extends past the opening.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:40.300
Green water appears between the two bodies.
The larger hull turns.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.700
The smaller body travels around the edge of the frame.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.413
The outlines meet again.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:55.422
Water Beings · Later in the same digital recording. [Silent]
